              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima naahurira eiraka rihango eririkuruga omuri hekalu nirigambira baamaraika mushanju riti: Mugyende, mushukye aha nsi enyabya mushanju z'ekiniga kya Ruhanga.",
