        },
        {
          "text": " Maraika ow'okubanza yaagyenda, yaashuka orwabya rwe aha nsi; abantu abaabaire baine akamanyiso k'egyo nyamaishwa nibaramya ekishushani kyayo baakwatwa ebironda bibi ebirikunuuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
