        {
          "text": " Maraika owa kataano yaashuka orwabya rwe aha kitebe ky'obukama ky'egyo nyamaishwa, obukama bwayo bwashwekwa omwirima; baayeruma endimi ahabw'obusaasi bwingi, ",
