            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Maraika owa mukaaga yaashuka orwabya rwe aha mugyera muhango, Furaati; amaizi gaagwo gaayoma, ngu omuhanda gushemezibwe ahabw'abagabe abarikuruga oburugwa-izooba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.12",
